{
  "info": {
    "name": "Plataforma MOOC - Multimedia",
    "description": "Carga directa al almacenamiento de objetos, confirmacion e idempotencia (issue A2).\n\nEjecutar con newman DENTRO de la red de docker compose: la URL prefirmada lleva el host dentro de la firma, asi que una peticion desde el anfitrion no puede completar la transferencia. Ver docs/entrega2/NOTAS_TECNICAS.md, nota 1.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Login como Profesor (autor)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"responde 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test(\"devuelve token de profesor\", function () {",
              "    var d = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(d.user.role).to.eql(\"profesor\");",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"professorToken\", d.token);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{professorEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{professorPassword}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
